<p>Open the vents on your furnace, creating a conic blast dealing up to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">249, 335, 402, 458, 508</acronym> fire damage at 10 molten points (currently 0.00).</p><p>All molten points are consumed.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Steampower.</p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">By fire be purged!</span></span></p><p></p>